1Ls,

Covington & Burling LLP will host a reception for first-year students on
Thursday, September 24 from 6-8pm in the Gewirz 12th Floor lounge.

Partners and associates from the firm's antitrust and privacy practices will
attend, along with several Georgetown Law alumni. This is an excellent
networking opportunity ahead of the 1L diversity fellowship application
deadline.

Heavy hors d'oeuvres and drinks will be served. Space is limited, RSVP in
Symplicity by Tuesday.

